    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44601" root="&#xA;                        وشى&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَشْىٌ</span></b> 
                        , originally an inf. n., <i>A kind of variegated, or figured, cloth, or garment.</i> (Mgh,
Msb. *) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَشْىٌ</span> The <i>variegation, figured work,
or figuring,</i> of a garment; <i>making</i> it <i>partycoloured.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَشى</span> sometimes signifies <i>A natural
diversity of colours:</i> see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُمْلَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَشْىٌ</span> of a
sword: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِرِنْدٌ</span>.

